Manifest is a love letter to Frontier: Elite 2, and Frontier First Encounters as well as a plethora of other space and market-sim
games that have come and some that still exist, such as the X series. This game will have my own personal style built into it.

Right now there are 3 Primary factions, like empires, two secondary factions (Syndicate and Navy) and there are real consequences
for every action. Blow up a ship delivering medical supplies to a system with a plague and that plague might reduce the tech level 
of that world due to the mass casualty event so caused. Be careful, the law is watching, and murder is harder to get away with than 
you'd think even in deep space. But there's always a place for outlaws.
